{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chicken virus spreads rapidly across the country and some of your chickens have gotten sick! You need to wash them, feed them and take good care of them to maintain a stable farm. Can you manage all those chickens?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's in this demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>demo</strong> is an early playable version of the game, showcasing the core gameplay loop: managing your chickens\u2019 health and hygiene. It\u2019s all about observation, time management, and a bit of chicken TLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709400/extras/pick-up.gif?t=1747087845\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why a Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo reflects the current state of CoopScoop. I'm sharing it to gather <strong>feedback, ideas, bug reports</strong>, and general thoughts on the experience. Your input will help shape the game\u2019s future. Thanks so much for playing! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What will be in the final release?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer (Co-Op and Versus)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockables in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different game modes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709400?t=1747087845","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709400?t=1747087845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709400/d4975b937ae0aa0c81513048306482768e6ebeaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747087845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709400/d4975b937ae0aa0c81513048306482768e6ebeaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747087845","categori